    <detaileddescription>
<para>par(con(32))) which we map on an execution place.</para>
<para>The goal of this intermediate class is to take the high-level spec description and compute how the different levels are mapped on the machine. In particular, how levels are mapped to the CUDA hierarchy (threads, blocks, devices). </para>
